        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Complementary or additional services that a transport service may offer alongside its main service or activity in order to enhance or improve the experience of a tourist with pets.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="eu">Garraio-zerbitzu batek bere zerbitzu edo jarduera nagusiarekin batera eskain ditzakeen zerbitzu osagarri edo gehigarriak, maskotak dituen turistaren esperientzia zabaltzeko edo hobetzeko.</rdfs:comment>
